<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: HFSV-40 "Landwhale" heavy ground-effect fire support vehicle -->
  <DNX_82AHoverVehicle.label>HFSV-40“陆鲸”重型地效火力支援车</DNX_82AHoverVehicle.label>
  <!-- EN: The HFSV-40 "Landwhale" is a heavy ground-effect fire support platform with a long service history, combining fire support, troop transport, and autonomous patrol capabilities. Its primary weapon is a high-power railgun, supported by rotary machine guns and rocket pods, allowing it to engage heavy armor, close-range infantry, and large clustered targets at the same time. Its powerful hover system lets it cross ravines, shallow water, ruins, and ordinary ground obstacles while maintaining mobility in the harsh environments of many different rimworlds.\n\nAs a common multipurpose platform in corporate colonial systems, the Landwhale was designed for the rapid development - official documents insist on that word - of unfamiliar planets. Its built-in autonomous combat AI can independently search for targets, plan routes, and operate every weapon system without a crew, though the manufacturer explicitly refuses liability for any friendly-fire incidents.\n\nIn a corporate promotional film, a Landwhale carries an engineering team across a river valley and settles slowly in front of a new colony.\nThe narrator says, "No matter how distant the world, we can bring civilization there."\nThen the railgun turns off-camera and fires, while the subtitle quietly adds, "The specific definition of civilization is subject to the local corporate charter." -->
  <DNX_82AHoverVehicle.description>HFSV-40“陆鲸”是一种拥有悠久服役历史的重型地效火力平台，兼具火力支援、兵员运输与自主巡逻能力。其主武器为大功率电磁炮，并配备轮式机枪与火箭支援炮，可同时处理重甲目标、近距离步兵和大范围集群；强劲的悬浮系统使它能够跨越沟壑、浅水、废墟与一般地面障碍，在不同边缘星球的恶劣环境中维持机动。\n\n作为企业殖民体系中相当常见的多用途平台，“陆鲸”专为快速开发——官方文件坚持使用这个词——陌生星球而设计；内置自动作战AI允许其在没有车组的情况下独立索敌、规划路线并使用全部武器，但制造商明确拒绝对任何友军伤害承担责任。\n\n企业宣传片里，一辆“陆鲸”载着工程队越过河谷，在新殖民地前缓缓降落。\n画外音说道：“无论多么遥远的世界，我们都能把文明送到那里。”\n随后电磁炮转向镜头外开火，字幕悄悄补充：“文明的具体定义以当地企业章程为准。”</DNX_82AHoverVehicle.description>
