  <DNX_82AHoverVehicle.comps.CompPrismLaserPointDefense.gizmoLabelOff>陆鲸激光拦截器：关闭</DNX_82AHoverVehicle.comps.CompPrismLaserPointDefense.gizmoLabelOff>
  <!-- EN: Landwhale laser interceptor: on -->
  <DNX_82AHoverVehicle.comps.CompPrismLaserPointDefense.gizmoLabelOn>陆鲸激光拦截器：开启</DNX_82AHoverVehicle.comps.CompPrismLaserPointDefense.gizmoLabelOn>
