  <!-- EN: destroyed Landwhale -->
  <DNX_DestroyedLandwhaleWreck.label>被摧毁的陆鲸</DNX_DestroyedLandwhaleWreck.label>
  <!-- EN: The wreckage of a downed HFSV-40 "Landwhale", a heavy ground-effect fire support platform with a long service history. Its frame is ruined, but traces of its railgun, rotary machine guns, rocket pods, hover system, transport bay, and autonomous combat AI remain intact enough to investigate or rebuild.\n\nCorporate colonial records describe the Landwhale as a multipurpose platform for the rapid development - official documents insist on that word - of unfamiliar planets. The manufacturer explicitly refuses liability for any friendly-fire incidents. -->
  <DNX_DestroyedLandwhaleWreck.description>一辆被击落的HFSV-40“陆鲸”残骸。“陆鲸”是一种拥有悠久服役历史的重型地效火力平台，残骸框架已经毁坏，但电磁炮、轮式机枪、火箭支援炮、悬浮系统、运输舱和自动作战AI仍留下了足以调查或重建的关键痕迹。\n\n企业殖民档案将“陆鲸”描述为一种用于快速开发——官方文件坚持使用这个词——陌生星球的多用途平台。制造商明确拒绝对任何友军伤害承担责任。</DNX_DestroyedLandwhaleWreck.description>
  <!-- EN: Analyze the destroyed Landwhale. -->
  <DNX_DestroyedLandwhaleWreck.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.activateDescString>分析被摧毁的陆鲸。</DNX_DestroyedLandwhaleWreck.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.activateDescString>
  <!-- EN: Analyze... -->
  <DNX_DestroyedLandwhaleWreck.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.activateLabelString>分析...</DNX_DestroyedLandwhaleWreck.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.activateLabelString>
  <!-- EN: By analyzing the destroyed Landwhale, {PAWN_labelShort} has recovered enough combat and lift-system data to make heavy hover platform theory research possible.\n\nYour researchers can now begin the project from the Defensive Network research tab once its normal prerequisites are met. -->
  <DNX_DestroyedLandwhaleWreck.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.completedLetter>通过分析被摧毁的陆鲸，{PAWN_labelShort} 回收了足够的战斗数据和升力系统数据，使重型悬浮平台理论研究成为可能。\n\n在满足常规前置条件后，你的研究员现在可以从防御网络研究标签页开始该项目。</DNX_DestroyedLandwhaleWreck.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.completedLetter>
  <!-- EN: Landwhale wreck analyzed: heavy hover platform theory available -->
  <DNX_DestroyedLandwhaleWreck.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.completedLetterLabel>陆鲸残骸分析：重型悬停平台理论可用</DNX_DestroyedLandwhaleWreck.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.completedLetterLabel>
  <!-- EN: Choose who should analyze this -->
  <DNX_DestroyedLandwhaleWreck.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.guiLabelString>选择分析人员</DNX_DestroyedLandwhaleWreck.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.guiLabelString>
  <!-- EN: Can be analyzed by a colonist. -->
  <DNX_DestroyedLandwhaleWreck.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.inspectString>可以由殖民者分析。</DNX_DestroyedLandwhaleWreck.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.inspectString>
